pgrades, event-enhanced cards can get some unique ways of strengthening.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1063140/extras/465964051b8dc2f811676480e65706af.poster.avif?t=1569203209\" width=598 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1063140/extras/465964051b8dc2f811676480e65706af.webm?t=1569203209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1063140/extras/465964051b8dc2f811676480e65706af.mp4?t=1569203209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Thrilling levels: Some levels will feel like a game of action game, requiring you to grasp the timing and location very accurately.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1063140/extras/aa7f96da9de9916b38a46c096d856971.poster.avif?t=1569203209\" width=598 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1063140/extras/aa7f96da9de9916b38a46c096d856971.webm?t=1569203209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1063140/extras/aa7f96da9de9916b38a46c096d856971.mp4?t=1569203209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Pet Upgrade: Every hero can choose a pet to follow at the beginning and take risks. Pets can be used at any time in battle, but he needs a rest after the battle is over.<br><br>Initial Card Group: Each hero is unlocked by talent and can choose one of the three Card Groups to take risks at the beginning.<br><br>Random cards: Choose your cards carefully! Choose whether or not to add them to your deck. Combine and match them so that the deck can exert its strength, defeat the enemy and challenge to reach the top.<br><br>Change spire: The structure of the spire changes every time you start the climb. Choose high-risk, high-return, or move cautiously? Face different enemies.<br><br>Powerful Treasure: You'll find all kinds of treasures that may react strongly with your deck to make a leap in your battle. But don't be too careless. Sometimes you pay the price to get the relics.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"15df436c3f9fb7cd9f912e733283b77a87652559.jpg","localized_name":"Rich Man","name":"Rich Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1063140/15df436c3f9fb7cd9f912e733283b77a87652559.jpg"},{"icon":"bcbffa6be0f1c6eae25f15dbccf71c5e7a650184.jpg","localized_name":"Magician","name":"Magician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1063140/bcbffa6be0f1c6eae25f15dbccf71c5e7a650184.jpg"},{"icon":"511f6276bf3fc8ab4071d5f885bbf551a71244c0.jpg","localized_name":"Collector","name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1063140/511f6276bf3fc8ab4071d5f885bbf551a71244c0.jpg"},{"icon":"04dbfa42f47c14dd5d8d3ed43e8f011cd6c25bb4.jpg","localized_name":"Minimalism","name":"Minimalism","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1063140/04dbfa42f47c14dd5d8d3ed43e8f011cd6c25bb4.jpg"},{"icon":"8b21471bf6f3c70e18c3b37643f7137532731e0a.jpg","localized_name":"The More","name":"The More","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1063140/8b21471bf6f3c70e18c3b37643f7137532731e0a.jpg"},{"icon":"751745d277a87c2ab59d55f2704c78bdaf835c66.jpg","localized_name":"Saved","name":"Saved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1063140/751745d277a87c2ab59d55f2704c78bdaf835c66.jpg"},{"icon":"eaca4b48f5bff4b9223b0f917e665ee8c94c30e7.jpg","localized_name":"The Weak","name":"The Weak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1063140/eaca4b48f5bff4b9223b0f917e6